            <property name="accessibleName">
             <string>Transport</string>
            </property>
            <property name="toolTip">
             <string>TCP connects to the receiving program and keeps the connection open. UDP sends each message as a datagram, without a connection. TCP server: ScoreSight listens on the port, and every program that connects to it gets the messages. WebSocket connects to a ws:// or wss:// URL and sends each message as a WebSocket message.</string>
